description = "It walks past the pipes, past the guns, past everything worth money, and goes to where the city sleeps. A wall stops it and a hole does not: whatever gets through spends the night on a housing block, and a housing block is not a building you lose, it is a list of names you read in the morning. This is the one in the roster that makes a leak cost people instead of metal."
